      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-07T18:14:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "All Recordings must be replayed into the Context which is not a thread safe object. So as long as the only interactions with the LazyProxyData on the Recording on done on the Context during insert I think we should be safe.",
